# Anchored: a bare `hooks/` also matches internal/hooks/, the Go package. That
# silently swallowed internal/hooks/on_source_connect.go, leaving path.go calling
# a function whose file was never committed -- internal/core stopped compiling and
# the published image quietly stopped tracking main for months. This rule is only
# meant to exclude the runtime hook scripts at the repo root.
/hooks/
